sition\":\"Keep the existing canonical Conversation Adapter, renderer slots and Composer. Layout changes inside this surface belong in project application composition or scoped CSS, without replacing the Runtime or adding component props to AppUIModel.\",\"styles\":\"The internal content has data-slot=agent-ui-thread-content and flex:1 with a column layout; the composer container has class aui-thread-viewport-footer. To keep the composer at the bottom even in an empty conversation, project CSS can override the content's justify-content and give its footer margin-top:auto. Scope selectors to this conversation surface and verify the actual desktop and narrow Host, including overflow, welcome content and messages.\"}},\"name\":\"Conversation Surface\",\"description\":\"ç»„åˆ Live ä¸Žåªè¯» History ä¼šè¯çš„ç©ºçŠ¶æ€ã€æ¶ˆæ¯æ—¶é—´çº¿ä¸Žè¾“å…¥åŒºã€‚\",\"capabilities\":[\"conversation-surface\"],\"selected\":true,\"currentInstances\":[{\"instanceId\":\"p9\",\"enabled\":true,\"target\":{\"type\":\"layout_slot\",\"slotRef\":\"l11\"},\"index\":0}],\"selectionOwner\":\"composition\",\"authoring\":{\"intents\":[\"show the primary live and historical conversation experience\"],\"visualRole\":\"primary conversation surface\",\"recommendedSize\":{\"width\":\"minmax(0, 1fr)\"}},\"requiredServices\":{\"names\":[\"agent-ui.conversations\"],\"status\":\"resolved\",\"missing\":[]},\"optionalServices\":{\"names\":[\"agent-ui.theme\",\"agent-ui.locale\"],\"available\":[\"agent-ui.theme\",\"agent-ui.locale\"]},\"childSlots\":{\"assistantResponseFooter\":{\"description\":\"Renderer displayed once beneath the final assistant message of a complete response.\",\"cardinality\":\"one\",\"mode\":\"renderer\",\"optional\":true,\"accepts\":{\"anyOfCapabilities\":[\"conversation-assistant-response-footer-renderer\"]}},\"composer\":{\"description\":\"Primary conversation composer.\",\"cardinality\":\"one\",\"optional\":true,\"accepts\":{\"anyOfCapabilities\":[\"conversation-composer\"]}},\"emptyS